    "content": "<p>Solidus Node: Foundry is back! From September 30 until <strong>October 14</strong>, Solidus Node: Foundry will be available in the map roster for all game modes through a separate unranked queue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This virtual environment is powered by Solidus and stripped of all metadata and visual markers that would pinpoint this node to any particular place. It may or may not represent a real high-value site somewhere in or outside the Wild Ten... The pay is good, though, so get to work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/07/247-Week3Events/1.png\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Gear up, equip your best War Robots, and grab your Crew for the ultimate combat simulation.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong><strong> </strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a> <strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One</strong></a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 506px; top: -5.33333px;\">\r\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>",
